550
00:46:11,272 --> 00:46:16,672
The regular version will have a foil-stamped replica signature and message, so it'll be just as cute!

551
00:46:16,972 --> 00:46:20,272
数量限定セットは直筆サイン付きだよ！
The limited quantity set comes with a handwritten signature!

552
00:46:20,472 --> 00:46:24,472
We put lots of love into each and every signature, so we hope you look forward to it!

553
00:46:24,672 --> 00:46:27,972
たくさんの愛情を込めてサイン書きますね！
We'll put lots of love into signing them!

554
00:46:28,272 --> 00:46:32,272
Please check out the hololive official online shop and look for the link in the description or comment area!

555
00:46:32,472 --> 00:46:33,672
Okay!

556
00:46:33,972 --> 00:46:37,472
ぜひホロライブ公式ショップにチェックしてください！
Please check out the Hololive official shop!

557
00:46:37,972 --> 00:46:38,972
BAU BAU!

558
00:46:39,272 --> 00:46:43,672
What did you think of our birthday merch? Pretty cute, huh?

559
00:46:43,972 --> 00:46:51,272
Well, the reservations will be going on sale right after the birthday live here ends! So don't forget, okay?

560
00:46:51,472 --> 00:46:56,072
生誕グッズの予約はこの後開始しますので...
Reservations for the birthday merch will start right after this...

561
00:46:56,272 --> 00:46:58,972
...お忘れずにチェックしてくださいね！
...so don't forget to check it out!

562
00:46:59,272 --> 00:47:04,272
You can click the link below or on the side here! Don't forget, okay?

563
00:47:04,472 --> 00:47:10,472
We put a lot of love into it, and Iikomochi... thank you Iikomochi mama!

564
00:47:10,472 --> 00:47:13,472
Right after this ends, time to go go go, okay? Go buy it!

565
00:47:15,272 --> 00:47:20,272
We've performed a lot of special collabs with a lot of dear senpais!

566
00:47:20,472 --> 00:47:23,472
But there's still one mystery guest we haven't met yet, right?

567
00:47:23,672 --> 00:47:27,272
まだ会ってない謎のゲストが1人いるんだよね！
There's still one mystery guest we haven't met yet!

568
00:47:29,472 --> 00:47:31,972
Shall we give the Ruffians a hint, Mococo?

569
00:47:32,272 --> 00:47:34,472
Ruffians, you're curious, right?

570
00:47:35,272 --> 00:47:38,472
Could it be... YAGOO-san? YAGOO-san?

571
00:47:38,672 --> 00:47:41,272
That's a good guess, maybe!

572
00:47:41,972 --> 00:47:43,972
Well, you'll see!

573
00:47:44,972 --> 00:47:47,472
Maybe you should get ready...

574
00:47:47,672 --> 00:47:51,272
...because, you know, they aren't quite as bad as Peroco...

575
00:47:51,472 --> 00:47:54,972
...but they can get pretty nasty sometimes!

576
00:47:55,272 --> 00:47:59,472
Mococo-chan, you're not going to be rude to our next guest or anything, right?

577
00:47:59,672 --> 00:48:02,272
Especially before calling them out!

578
00:48:02,472 --> 00:48:03,672
We'll see!

579
00:48:04,472 --> 00:48:07,272
Let's get them out here then!

580
00:48:07,472 --> 00:48:09,972
Could it be? Could it be?

581
00:48:10,272 --> 00:48:12,472
Okay! せーの...
Okay! Ready, set...

582
00:48:12,472 --> 00:48:13,672
どうぞー！
Here they come!

583
00:48:14,972 --> 00:48:19,472
わー！来たしんよ、来たしんよ！来たしんよ！あきんつー！
Waaah! I've arrived-shin! I've arrived-shin! I've arrived-shin! Akin-tsu!

584
00:48:20,472 --> 00:48:22,972
ちゅ！ちゅ！ちゅ！
Chu! Chu! Chu!

585
00:48:23,472 --> 00:48:25,272
自己紹介お願いします！
Please introduce yourself!

586
00:48:25,472 --> 00:48:27,972
クロちゃんです！わー！
I'm Kuro-chan! Waaah!

587
00:48:28,472 --> 00:48:31,272
クロちゃんしんよー！
Kuro-chan-shin!

588
00:48:31,472 --> 00:48:33,472
初めまして！
Nice to meet you!

589
00:48:33,672 --> 00:48:35,672
チワワじゃないよ！フワワだよ！
Not a chihuahua! I'm Fuwawa!

590
00:48:35,972 --> 00:48:39,272
フワワじゃないよ！モココだよ！
Not Fuwawa! I'm Mococo!

591
00:48:39,472 --> 00:48:42,272
2人合わせて...
Together we are...

592
00:48:42,272 --> 00:48:43,672
...フワモコです！
...FUWAMOCO!

593
00:48:43,972 --> 00:48:47,272
よろしくお願いします！
Nice to meet you!

594
00:48:47,472 --> 00:48:52,472
フワモコのわちゃわちゃバースデーフェスティバルに来てくれてありがとうございます！
Thank you for coming to Fuwamoco's Wacha Wacha Birthday Festival!

595
00:48:52,672 --> 00:48:53,672
Thank you!

596
00:48:53,972 --> 00:48:57,272
ハッピーバースデーだしんよ！フワモコー！
Happy Birthday-shin, FUWAMOCO!

597
00:48:57,472 --> 00:48:59,472
いい一年ね！
Have a great year!

598
00:48:59,672 --> 00:49:00,972
ありがとう！
Thank you!

599
00:49:01,272 --> 00:49:05,972
ちょっとね、視聴者のラフィアンズはたくさんいると思いますけど...
Um, I'm sure there are many Ruffians watching right now, but...

600
00:49:06,272 --> 00:49:09,972
...クロちゃんがどんな人なのか説明してもらえますか？
...could you explain to them what kind of person Kuro-chan is?

601
00:49:10,472 --> 00:49:12,472
自分で描くの？それ！
I have to do it myself?!

602
00:49:12,672 --> 00:49:13,472
そう！Introduction!
Yes! Introduction!

603
00:49:13,672 --> 00:49:17,272
分かったしんよ！だってこれ海外の人も見てますもんね？
Got it-shin! Because overseas fans are watching too, right?

604
00:49:17,472 --> 00:49:20,972
海外の人でも分かる自己紹介しますからね！
I'll do an introduction that overseas fans can understand!

605
00:49:21,472 --> 00:49:25,972
Nice to meet you! Nice to meet you! Chu! Chu! Chu! Chu! Chu-lip!

606
00:49:26,472 --> 00:49:28,472
Ah... Ow...

607
00:49:28,672 --> 00:49:30,472
困らないで！
Don't look so troubled!

608
00:49:30,672 --> 00:49:33,672
え、クロちゃんは... え、チューリップ？
Wait, Kuro-chan is... a tulip?

609
00:49:33,972 --> 00:49:35,972
いや、チューリップ No No No No!
No, tulip No No No No!

610
00:49:36,472 --> 00:49:39,272
ちょっとまだ分からないかもしれないから...
They might not understand yet, so...

611
00:49:39,472 --> 00:49:44,272
えーっとね、安田大サーカスっていうトリオを組んでる芸人さんで...
Well, I'm a comedian in a trio called Yasuda Dai Circus...

612
00:49:44,472 --> 00:49:49,272
...あと豆柴の大群のプロデューサーもやってまして、作詞とかもしてます、クロちゃんです！
...and I'm also the producer for Mameshiba no Taigun and write lyrics. I'm Kuro-chan!

613
00:49:49,472 --> 00:49:50,972
BAU BAU!

614
00:49:51,272 --> 00:49:53,972
じゃあ今回は英語でお願いします！
Well then, please do it in English this time!

615
00:49:54,472 --> 00:49:55,472
僕が？
Me?

616
00:49:55,672 --> 00:49:56,472
Yes!

617
00:49:56,472 --> 00:49:57,472
自分で？
By myself?

618
00:49:57,672 --> 00:50:00,972
そんなこと急に言われたら... It's shy flower!
If you ask me so suddenly... It's shy flower!

619
00:50:01,927 --> 00:50:03,727
言い訳はなし！
No excuses!

620
00:50:03,727 --> 00:50:05,427
聞いてる人の話！
I'm listening to what you're saying!

621
00:50:05,427 --> 00:50:09,427
英語... えっと、なんだろう... えっと...
English... Um, what is it... um...

622
00:50:09,427 --> 00:50:12,427
Famous comedian!

623
00:50:12,427 --> 00:50:16,427
And Idol Producer!

624
00:50:16,427 --> 00:50:18,727
やってるしんよ！
That's what I do, shin!

625
00:50:18,727 --> 00:50:21,427
できるー！
Impressive~!

626
00:50:21,427 --> 00:50:23,927
クロちゃんテレビでよく見てるけど...
We see Kuro-chan on TV all the time, but...

627
00:50:23,927 --> 00:50:29,727
ちょっとフワモコのペットのペロちゃんと似てるところがたくさんあるね！
you actually have a lot in common with FUWAMOCO's pet, Pero!

628
00:50:29,727 --> 00:50:34,727
後ろの姿を見てください！
Look at him from behind!

629
00:50:34,727 --> 00:50:38,427
似てる！そっくり！ペロです！
They look so alike! Exactly the same! It's Pero!

630
00:50:38,427 --> 00:50:41,927
待って！丸いところだけが似てるんじゃない？
Wait! Isn't it just that we're both round?

631
00:50:41,927 --> 00:50:44,427
それだけじゃない！
Not just that!

632
00:50:44,427 --> 00:50:51,727
クロちゃんと似てるところは、嘘つきで、女の子好きで、いやらしい！
How you're like Kuro-chan is... you're a liar, you love girls, and you're perverted!

633
00:50:51,727 --> 00:50:54,427
だからね、見た目で騙されないで！
So don't be fooled by appearances!

634
00:50:54,427 --> 00:50:57,127
クロちゃんはそんなので大丈夫なの？と言われて...
Is Kuro-chan really okay being told all that...?

635
00:50:57,127 --> 00:51:01,927
いやひどい！悲しくなってきた！え〜んえ〜ん...
That's so mean! Now I'm sad! Waaah, waaah...

636
00:51:01,927 --> 00:51:04,427
えー！
Eh!?

637
00:51:04,427 --> 00:51:08,427
全然人の言うこと聞かないよね、君たちは！
You two don't listen to a word anyone says, do you!

638
00:51:08,427 --> 00:51:14,927
できれば... クロちゃんはペロのお友達になってくれませんか？
If possible... could Kuro-chan become Pero's friend?

639
00:51:14,927 --> 00:51:17,927
えっ、フワモコの友達じゃなくてペロの友達なの？
Huh? Not FUWAMOCO's friend, but Pero's friend?

640
00:51:17,927 --> 00:51:21,927
フワモコはクロちゃんとお友達になりたくないから！
Because FUWAMOCO doesn't want to be Kuro-chan's friend!

641
00:51:21,927 --> 00:51:25,427
おかしくない、それ？ いやいや、気持ち悪いから！
Isn't that weird? No, no, because you're gross!

642
00:51:25,427 --> 00:51:30,427
気持ち悪くない！マニアック受ける！ 違う！気持ち悪い、やっぱり！
I'm not gross! I have niche appeal! No! You're gross after all!

643
00:51:30,427 --> 00:51:35,927
でもでも、モコちゃん... ちょっとやりすぎですよ！失礼です！
But Moco-chan... that's going a bit too far! That's rude!

644
00:51:35,927 --> 00:51:42,927
もしペロと仲良くなってほしいんだったのなら、可愛らしく頼んだ方がいいんじゃない？
If you want me to get along with Pero, shouldn't you ask me nicely?

645
00:51:42,927 --> 00:51:46,427
はあー！？ No!
Huh!? No!

646
00:51:46,427 --> 00:51:48,927
しっかりとした否定！
Such a firm rejection!

647
00:51:48,927 --> 00:51:53,927
けどペロ可愛いから仲良くなってもいいとは思ってるよ！
But Pero is cute, so I wouldn't mind being friends with him!

648
00:51:53,927 --> 00:51:59,927
嬉しい！可愛くないけど、仲良くなってくれたら嬉しいかな！
Yay! He's not cute, but we'd be happy if you became friends!

649
00:51:59,927 --> 00:52:02,927
感情がいろいろありすぎるのよ、本当に！
You have way too many mixed emotions, seriously!

650
00:52:02,927 --> 00:52:09,427
まあまあ！クロちゃんって芸人さんだけど、アイドルになりたいんですよね？
Now, now! Kuro-chan is a comedian, but you want to be an idol, right?

651
00:52:09,427 --> 00:52:17,927
そう、元々アイドルになろうと思ったのに騙されて芸人にさせられたから... アイドルは本当に夢！ドリーム！
Yeah, I originally wanted to be an idol, but I was tricked into becoming a comedian... So being an idol is my dream! Dream!

652
00:52:17,927 --> 00:52:23,427
なんか悲しいな... かわいそう... でもドリームって大事ですから！
That's kind of sad... Poor thing... But dreams are important!

653
00:52:23,427 --> 00:52:31,927
クロちゃんのドリームはアイドルなんだから、せっかくなら一緒に歌ってくれませんか？
Since Kuro-chan's dream is to be an idol, why don't you sing with us while you're here?

654
00:52:31,927 --> 00:52:36,927
いいしんよ、いいしんよ！オッケーだしんよ！ 一緒に踊れるんだね！
Sure, sure! OK, shin! So we can dance together!

655
00:52:36,927 --> 00:52:41,927
この曲ね！ ハードル上げないで！
This song! Don't raise the bar too high!

656
00:52:41,927 --> 00:52:49,927
大丈夫ですよ！アイドルのプロデュースもやってるし！実力見せてよー！
It'll be fine! You even produce idols! Show us what you've got!

657
00:52:49,927 --> 00:52:53,427
オッケーだしんよ！行くしんよ！
Okay, shin! Here I go!

658
00:52:53,427 --> 00:52:58,927
すごく可愛い曲を一緒に歌いましょう！ 楽しみ！
Let's sing a super cute song together! I can't wait!

659
00:52:58,927 --> 00:53:01,927
オッケー！
Okay!

660
00:53:01,927 --> 00:53:06,427
じゃあ、一緒にタイトルコールしましょうね！ せーの！
Let's introduce the title together! Ready, set!

661
00:53:06,427 --> 00:53:10,427
ちゅ、多様性。 多様性あんの！？
Chu, Tayousei. There's diversity!?

662
00:53:28,927 --> 00:53:31,727
我愛你 酔いが醒めない
Wo ai ni, I'm so intoxicated

663
00:53:31,727 --> 00:53:34,927
Oh, I need you 恋が醒めない
Oh, I need you, I can't snap out of love

664
00:53:34,927 --> 00:53:39,927
お生憎様の慣れ果て察して
Pity what I've become, just read between the lines

665
00:53:41,727 --> 00:53:44,727
無問題 破滅してみて
No problem, go on and ruin yourself

666
00:53:44,727 --> 00:53:47,927
Hold me tight トラウマの味
Hold me tight, tasting of trauma

667
00:53:47,927 --> 00:53:52,927
猛反対 お手 お座りでハイ♡報酬
Strongly opposed, sit and shake for your sweet reward♡

668
00:53:52,927 --> 00:53:56,927
喉の奥がチクンチクン
A sting in the back of my throat

669
00:53:56,927 --> 00:53:59,927
僕はドクンドクン
My heart's pounding loud

670
00:53:59,927 --> 00:54:05,427
鼓動で孤独消してみせてよ
Make my loneliness vanish with your heartbeat

671
00:54:05,427 --> 00:54:09,927
愛も恋も独裁して
Rule over all my love and affection

672
00:54:09,927 --> 00:54:12,927
僕を独占して
Keep me all to yourself

673
00:54:12,927 --> 00:54:18,427
このまま中毒になるまでチューしよう
Let me kiss you till we're both addicted

674
00:54:18,427 --> 00:54:21,927
Get get get on! Get get get on! Get on chu!

675
00:54:21,927 --> 00:54:24,927
Get get get get on chu!

676
00:54:24,927 --> 00:54:29,927
熱く とろけるくらいに 溢れた気持ちが
Overflowing emotions, hot enough to melt away

677
00:54:29,927 --> 00:54:32,427
たまらないでしょ
It's irresistible, isn't it?

678
00:54:32,427 --> 00:54:35,127
Get get get on! Get get get on! Get on chu!

679
00:54:35,127 --> 00:54:37,727
Get get get get on chu! Get on! Get on!

680
00:54:37,727 --> 00:54:40,727
我愛你 無問題
Wo ai ni, no problem

681
00:54:40,727 --> 00:54:43,927
Get get get on chu!

682
00:54:43,927 --> 00:54:46,927
ポン・チー・カン 勝負はいつもトンチンカン
Pon, chii, kan—the game is always absurd

683
00:54:46,927 --> 00:54:50,927
僕に言わせりゃ ちんぷんかんぷんだ
If you ask me, it's all complete gibberish

684
00:54:50,927 --> 00:54:56,427
最後はロンでしょ？
In the end, it's a win, right?

685
00:54:56,427 --> 00:54:59,927
もう何回？ 殺られればいい
How many times do I have to get destroyed?

686
00:54:59,927 --> 00:55:02,927
Oh, one night 忘れられない
Oh, one night, unforgettable

687
00:55:03,348 --> 00:55:08,348
終わんないで トキメキ 偏愛♥予習
Don't let it end, this heartbeat, prep work for my biased love.

688
00:55:08,748 --> 00:55:12,348
喉の奥が チュンチュン
Deep in my throat, it's chirping away,

689
00:55:12,548 --> 00:55:15,448
僕は ドクドク
and my heart is throbbing.

690
00:55:15,748 --> 00:55:20,748
心臓ごと 引きずり出してみせてよ
Drag out my heart and show it to me.

691
00:55:21,548 --> 00:55:24,548
きもちいいね 面倒くさいけど
It feels good, even if it's a hassle,

692
00:55:24,748 --> 00:55:27,748
やっぱ 照れくさいけど
but as expected, it's embarrassing.

693
00:55:28,048 --> 00:55:33,248
死ぬまで 忘れられない チュー しよ
Let me give you an unforgettable kiss till death.

694
00:55:33,748 --> 00:55:37,248
いかれた街は ゾンビで溢れる
This crazy town is overflowing with zombies.

695
00:55:37,748 --> 00:55:40,448
君は僕に 恋してる
You're in love with me.

696
00:55:40,748 --> 00:55:45,248
ときめく胸に 繋がるロープを 引きなよ
Pull the cord connected to my fluttering heart!

697
00:55:46,748 --> 00:55:52,548
行くよ！ Bet bet bet on! Bet on chu!
Here we go! Bet bet bet on! Bet on chu!

698
00:55:52,748 --> 00:55:57,548
本気で狂えるくらいの 鬱々しさが
This gloominess that could truly drive one mad,

699
00:55:57,748 --> 00:55:59,548
美しいでしょ
it's beautiful, isn't it?

700
00:55:59,748 --> 00:56:04,748
Get get get on! Get on chu!

701
00:56:04,948 --> 00:56:08,548
せーの ポン・チー・カン 終わんない
Ready, set! Pon, chii, kan, it never ends!

702
00:56:08,748 --> 00:56:11,548
Get Get Get on chu!

703
00:56:11,748 --> 00:56:14,548
ほらね 我愛你 無問題
See? I love you, no problem!

704
00:56:14,748 --> 00:56:18,248
Get Get Get on chu!

705
00:56:24,248 --> 00:56:25,948
わー！やったー！
Yay! We did it!

706
00:56:26,148 --> 00:56:28,548
うまくいったしんよー！
It went so well, shin-yo!

707
00:56:28,748 --> 00:56:30,748
ありがとう！よかったー！
Thank you! That was great!

708
00:56:30,848 --> 00:56:32,548
頑張ったね、クロちゃん！
You worked so hard, Kuro-chan!

709
00:56:32,748 --> 00:56:36,248
楽しかった！ありがとう！
That was so fun! Thank you!

710
00:56:36,748 --> 00:56:40,248
えっとね、サヨナラする前に...
Um, before we say goodbye...

711
00:56:40,548 --> 00:56:43,248
えっと、1個お願いしてもいいですか？
Can we make one request?

712
00:56:43,548 --> 00:56:45,148
1個だけだしんやー！
Just one thing, shin-ya!

713
00:56:45,248 --> 00:56:46,948
1個だけじゃーん！
Yeah, just one thing!

714
00:56:47,248 --> 00:56:50,748
えっと、FUWAMOCOは魔界の番犬で...
Um, FUWAMOCO are guard dogs of the Demon World...

715
00:56:50,948 --> 00:56:53,748
「バウバウ」よく言ってるんですけど...
...and we often say "Bau Bau," but...

716
00:56:53,948 --> 00:57:00,548
クロちゃん、カメラに向かって、FUWAMOCOのように可愛い「バウバウ」してもらえますか？
Kuro-chan, could you look at the camera and give us a cute "Bau Bau" like FUWAMOCO?

717
00:57:00,948 --> 00:57:03,548
えー！できるかしん...
Eh?! I wonder if I can do it, shin...

718
00:57:03,748 --> 00:57:05,248
行くしんよー！
Here I go, shin-yo!

719
00:57:05,748 --> 00:57:07,748
バウ！バウ！
Bau! Bau!

720
00:57:07,948 --> 00:57:10,748
え〜、バウ？それがベスト？
Eh~ Bau? Is that your best?

721
00:57:10,948 --> 00:57:13,948
もう一回！もっとやって！
One more time! Do it more!

722
00:57:14,748 --> 00:57:16,948
バウ！バウ！
Bau! Bau!

723
00:57:17,548 --> 00:57:19,548
か、可愛いかな...？
Is... is it cute...?

724
00:57:19,948 --> 00:57:23,748
実はおもう1個やりたいことがあるんですけど...
Actually, there's one more thing we want to do...

725
00:57:23,948 --> 00:57:30,548
さっきやりましたけど、FUWAMOCOはいつもやってる自己紹介があって...
Like we did earlier, FUWAMOCO always has a self-introduction we do...

726
00:57:30,748 --> 00:57:33,548
できれば3人で一緒にやりたいです！
If possible, we'd like to do it together with all 3 of us!

727
00:57:33,948 --> 00:57:36,748
あれ可愛かったからやりたい、クロちゃんも！
That was cute, so Kuro-chan wants to do it too!

728
00:57:36,948 --> 00:57:38,748
じゃあ、行きますよー！
Okay, here we go!

729
00:57:38,948 --> 00:57:42,248
チワワじゃないよ！フワワだよ！
I'm not a Chihuahua! I'm Fuwawa!

730
00:57:42,548 --> 00:57:44,748
フワワじゃないよ！クロちゃんだよ！
I'm not Fuwawa! I'm Kuro-chan!

731
00:57:45,248 --> 00:57:48,548
クロちゃんじゃないよ！モココだよ！
I'm not Kuro-chan! I'm Mococo!

732
00:57:48,748 --> 00:57:50,948
3人合わせて...
All 3 of us together...

733
00:57:51,048 --> 00:57:53,748
いやいやいや！ポンポン！
No, no, no! Pon pon!

734
00:57:54,248 --> 00:57:58,248
ちょっと！クロちゃん、出てこないから！なんそれ！
Wait! Kuro-chan, you're not in it! What was that?!

735
00:57:58,748 --> 00:58:02,548
もう、嘘とかつくの良くないよね！
Seriously, telling lies isn't good, is it?!

736
00:58:02,748 --> 00:58:06,248
謝らないと、モココ、パーンチしちゃう！
You have to apologize, or Mococo will punch you!

737
00:58:06,548 --> 00:58:10,248
うわー！いやー！
Whoa! Ya!

738
00:58:10,548 --> 00:58:12,248
救急車、1台...！
Call an ambulance...!

739
00:58:12,548 --> 00:58:15,548
いらないよ！もう嘘...
You don't need one! No more lies...

740
00:58:15,748 --> 00:58:18,248
プンプン！
Hmph, hmph!

741
00:58:18,748 --> 00:58:21,548
落ち着いて、落ち着いて...
Calm down, calm down...

742
00:58:21,748 --> 00:58:24,748
大丈夫、モコちゃん、大丈夫。
It's okay, Moco-chan, it's okay.

743
00:58:24,948 --> 00:58:31,548
クロちゃんはこれからもみんなをいっぱい笑顔にして、素敵なアイドルになってくださいね！
Kuro-chan, please keep making everyone smile and be a wonderful idol!

744
00:58:31,748 --> 00:58:34,748
マジ心...！
Really, from my heart...!

745
00:58:34,948 --> 00:58:39,748
じゃあ、モコちゃん、最後にクロちゃんにハイタッチしてお別れしようね。
So Moco-chan, let's high-five Kuro-chan at the end and say goodbye.

746
00:58:40,248 --> 00:58:43,748
仲直り、仲直り、いい？
Make up, make up, okay?

747
00:58:43,948 --> 00:58:47,748
ハイタッチ、ハイタッチ！
High touch, high touch!

748
00:58:47,948 --> 00:58:52,748
やってみて、やってみて！
Try it, try it!

749
00:58:52,948 --> 00:58:55,748
やだー！
No way~!

750
00:58:55,948 --> 00:58:59,748
バイバイー！
Bye-bye~!

751
00:59:00,248 --> 00:59:04,748
FUWAMOCOちゃん、本当にお誕生日おめでとうございます！
FUWAMOCO, happy birthday to you both!

752
00:59:04,948 --> 00:59:07,748
ありがとうー！
Thank you~!

753
00:59:07,948 --> 00:59:12,248
キュンからのバッキュン！おめでとうハート！
Heartbeat then bang! Congratulations heart!

754
00:59:12,548 --> 00:59:14,748
Let's keep going!

755
00:59:20,948 --> 00:59:29,248
花火！バウバウ！花火、イェーイ！玉屋〜！玉屋〜！
Fireworks! Bau bau! Fireworks, yeah! Tamaya~! Tamaya~!

756
00:59:29,748 --> 00:59:32,748
わぁ〜！
Wow!

757
00:59:33,248 --> 00:59:36,748
Things kind of got really crazy, I'm not too sure what happened...

758
00:59:36,948 --> 00:59:40,948
色々ありすぎて分からなくなってきたかも！
So much happened, I'm starting to get confused!

759
00:59:41,248 --> 00:59:44,248
But we still have one more... One more!

760
00:59:44,548 --> 00:59:49,748
Very exciting tradition, you know! まだまだお楽しみがあるよ！
Very exciting tradition, you know! We still have more fun in store!

761
00:59:49,948 --> 00:59:54,748
Maybe Ruffians, can you guess what it is? 何かな？何かな？
Maybe Ruffians, can you guess what it is? What could it be? What could it be?

762
00:59:55,248 --> 01:00:01,248
FUWAMOCO 1st Anniversary...

763
01:00:01,629 --> 01:00:02,829
We released our 1st...

764
01:00:02,829 --> 01:00:04,329
...1st original song,

765
01:00:04,329 --> 01:00:06,329
"Going to be 1st"!

766
01:00:06,329 --> 01:00:08,529
And then for our 2nd anniversary,

767
01:00:08,529 --> 01:00:10,729
we were able to release "Lifetime Showtime"!

768
01:00:10,729 --> 01:00:14,529
An original song that's grown with us along this journey,

769
01:00:14,529 --> 01:00:17,029
a very special song.

770
01:00:17,029 --> 01:00:19,729
And, you know, for FUWAMOCO,

771
01:00:19,729 --> 01:00:23,529
singing and dancing is something that means so much to us!

772
01:00:23,529 --> 01:00:25,029
Yeah, music!

773
01:00:25,029 --> 01:00:29,529
And Ruffians, might have heard that you'd like to hear more from us too, right?

774
01:00:29,529 --> 01:00:31,029
Right! Yeah!

775
01:00:31,029 --> 01:00:33,029
What do you think? Yeah!

776
01:00:34,029 --> 01:00:35,329
Wow!

777
01:00:35,529 --> 01:00:38,029
Our announcement is...

778
01:00:38,029 --> 01:00:39,729
Drumroll...

779
01:00:39,729 --> 01:00:41,529
Aki-chan drumroll, yes!

780
01:00:46,329 --> 01:00:47,329
Then...

781
01:00:47,329 --> 01:00:50,329
A new original song!

782
01:00:50,329 --> 01:00:52,029
Yeah!

783
01:00:52,029 --> 01:00:54,329
新オリジナル曲！
A new original song!

784
01:00:54,529 --> 01:00:57,329
And this song is extra special!

785
01:00:57,329 --> 01:00:59,529
It's written by none other than the legendary...

786
01:00:59,529 --> 01:01:02,329
...rock idol song composer...

787
01:01:02,329 --> 01:01:04,029
...Matsukuma Kenta-san!

788
01:01:04,029 --> 01:01:07,029
Who's worked with many famous idol groups that we love!

789
01:01:07,029 --> 01:01:11,029
Also written music for the idol group that Kuro-chan produces,

790
01:01:11,029 --> 01:01:13,529
Mameshiba no Taigun-san!
Mameshiba no Taigun!

791
01:01:13,529 --> 01:01:14,729
Yeah!

792
01:01:14,729 --> 01:01:17,529
But Ruffians, you might be a little bit surprised, okay?

793
01:01:17,529 --> 01:01:20,029
So get ready!

794
01:01:20,029 --> 01:01:22,029
Ruffians, with this song...

795
01:01:22,029 --> 01:01:23,529
...we'd like to express...

796
01:01:23,529 --> 01:01:27,029
...our rawest feelings as demon dogs!

797
01:01:30,329 --> 01:01:32,529
DEMON'S RESIDENCE

798
01:01:56,329 --> 01:02:01,329
「相棒、どこへ行こうか」 ネオンの脇を抜け
"Partner, where shall we go?" Passing through the neon lights,

799
01:02:01,329 --> 01:02:06,329
バブルガムがはじけたら let's go
once the bubblegum pops, let's go.

800
01:02:06,329 --> 01:02:11,329
最低な夜を潜って僕らは群れをなす
Diving through the worst of nights, we form a pack.

801
01:02:11,329 --> 01:02:16,329
「あの頃よりもマシだね」 my way
"It's better than back then, isn't it?" My way.

802
01:02:16,329 --> 01:02:21,729
「不完全なんです」 首輪をつけた
"We're incomplete," putting on our collars.

803
01:02:21,729 --> 01:02:27,029
良い子なんかじゃもうイヤ ah
We're done playing the good kids, ah!

804
01:02:27,029 --> 01:02:29,529
DEMON'S RESIDENCE 噛みついていけ
DEMON'S RESIDENCE, sink your teeth in!

805
01:02:29,529 --> 01:02:34,329
この街は檻のようで 気分はどうだい 泣いているのかい
This town is like a cage. How do you feel? Are you crying?

806
01:02:34,329 --> 01:02:39,029
鎖をちぎって 叫んでいたんだ stray dogs
Tearing off our chains, we wanted to scream out, stray dogs!

807
01:02:39,029 --> 01:02:45,729
彼方へと飛ぶ鳥を 見上げるだけかい それでいいのかい
Are you just looking up at the birds flying far away? Is that enough for you?

808
01:02:45,729 --> 01:02:50,329
燃えるなら ほら青く
If you're gonna burn, burn bright blue!

809
01:02:57,329 --> 01:03:02,329
「説教なんかいらない」 スプレー缶振って
"We don't need lectures," shaking up the spray can,

810
01:03:02,329 --> 01:03:07,329
イタズラ書きで彩る runway
painting the runway with graffiti.

811
01:03:07,329 --> 01:03:12,329
愛情なんか coin toss 誰に bet するのか
Love is a coin toss—who are you betting on?

812
01:03:12,329 --> 01:03:17,729
不確定要素ばかりね lonely
It's all uncertain variables, lonely.

813
01:03:17,729 --> 01:03:23,529
二人でひとつと決めた
We decided that the two of us are one.

814
01:03:23,529 --> 01:03:28,529
あの目を忘れない ah
I'll never forget those eyes, ah!

815
01:03:28,529 --> 01:03:33,329
DEMON'S RESIDENCE 満天の空
DEMON'S RESIDENCE, under a star-filled sky.

816
01:03:33,329 --> 01:03:35,329
あの星がひどく不快で
Those stars are terribly irritating,

817
01:03:35,329 --> 01:03:38,329
勝利はどうだい 味があるのかい
how does victory taste? Does it have any flavor?

818
01:03:38,329 --> 01:03:41,529
鎖を噛んで 唸っていたんだ stray dogs 僕ら
Biting on our chains, we were growling—stray dogs, that's us.

819
01:03:41,529 --> 01:03:44,029
宇宙さえも撃ち落として
Shooting down even the universe itself,

820
01:03:44,029 --> 01:03:46,529
見下ろす奈落 ビルは輝く
looking down into the abyss as skyscrapers shine.

821
01:03:46,529 --> 01:03:50,529
LOL Now I am free

822
01:04:14,329 --> 01:04:19,529
孤独を分け合い食べた
We shared and swallowed our solitude.

823
01:04:19,529 --> 01:04:24,529
あの目を忘れない
I'll never forget those eyes.

824
01:04:24,529 --> 01:04:29,529
夜を睨んだ stray dogs そうだ
Stray dogs glaring into the night, that's right.

825
01:04:29,529 --> 01:04:32,329
怪物はいずれのほうさ
Which one of us is the real monster?

826
01:04:32,329 --> 01:04:34,529
抜け出せるのかい 足は動くかい
Can you break free? Are your legs moving?

827
01:04:34,529 --> 01:04:37,029
走るならいま
If you're going to run, now's the time!

828
01:04:37,029 --> 01:04:39,729
DEMON'S RESIDENCE stray dogs 僕ら
DEMON'S RESIDENCE, stray dogs, that's us!

829
01:04:39,729 --> 01:04:42,529
この街を駆け抜けて行け
Dash through this town!

830
01:04:42,529 --> 01:04:45,329
地獄の果てに何が見えるかい
What can you see at the end of hell?

831
01:04:45,329 --> 01:04:47,529
鎖をちぎって 叫んでいたんだ stray dogs 僕ら
Tearing off our chains, we were screaming—stray dogs, that's us.

832
01:04:47,529 --> 01:04:49,529
この街は檻のようで
This town is like a cage.

833
01:04:49,529 --> 01:04:52,529
君ならどうだい 共に駆けるかい
How about you? Will you run together with us?

834
01:04:52,529 --> 01:04:57,029
夜明けが合図だ 行こう
Daybreak is the signal—let's go!

835
01:05:51,784 --> 01:05:53,784
Oaff!

836
01:05:54,384 --> 01:05:57,784
Thank you for always being here for us, Ruffians!

837
01:05:58,384 --> 01:06:01,584
Please listen to... side by side!

838
01:06:04,584 --> 01:06:12,084
Finally we made it through but not without some tears

839
01:06:12,584 --> 01:06:19,084
With the help of friends so true we faced all of our fears

840
01:06:19,584 --> 01:06:26,384
Now we're here to celebrate all that we have done

841
01:06:26,584 --> 01:06:30,384
I can feel it's more than just a game of fate

842
01:06:30,584 --> 01:06:34,584
'Cause our stories have just begun

843
01:06:35,584 --> 01:06:39,084
Hand in hand we're not waiting on tomorrow

844
01:06:39,384 --> 01:06:43,084
From now on it's the heart that we will follow

845
01:06:43,384 --> 01:06:46,584
We'll move on past the heartbreak and the sorrow if you

846
01:06:46,784 --> 01:06:50,384
Stay by my side

847
01:06:50,584 --> 01:06:57,584
Dancing harmonies feeding the music as we come alive, and sparks ignite

848
01:06:58,084 --> 01:07:05,584
We're making memories everyday underneath the summer sky and through the night
We're making memories every day underneath the summer sky and through the night

849
01:07:06,084 --> 01:07:13,084
We're singing melodies every time we hear music from inside as hearts collide

850
01:07:13,584 --> 01:07:17,084
Bringing out the best in each other

851
01:07:17,384 --> 01:07:21,384
Now we're feeling free like we're meant to be

852
01:07:21,584 --> 01:07:25,384
Even though there's been ruff times where nobody wanted us,

853
01:07:25,584 --> 01:07:28,384
We kept going, and we kept dreaming!

854
01:07:28,584 --> 01:07:31,384
Now we're here, we're not alone anymore!

855
01:07:31,584 --> 01:07:34,384
We'll be here together! We have smiles to protect!

856
01:07:34,584 --> 01:07:36,384
C'mon, let's go!

857
01:07:36,584 --> 01:07:44,084
Dancing harmonies feeding the music as we come alive, and sparks ignite

858
01:07:44,384 --> 01:07:51,784
We're making memories everyday underneath the summer sky and through the night
We're making memories every day underneath the summer sky and through the night

859
01:07:52,084 --> 01:07:59,384
We're singing melodies every time we hear music from inside as hearts collide

860
01:07:59,584 --> 01:08:03,384
Bringing out the best in each other

861
01:08:03,584 --> 01:08:07,384
Now we're feeling free like we're meant to be

862
01:08:07,584 --> 01:08:38,084
Nya-nya-nya, nya-nya-nya...

863
01:08:39,084 --> 01:08:41,084
Oaff!

864
01:08:45,784 --> 01:08:49,084
Thank you for the encore, Ruffians!

865
01:08:49,084 --> 01:08:51,584
That was side by side!

866
01:08:51,584 --> 01:08:58,084
We're really happy to sing side by side for you for the first time live today!

867
01:08:58,384 --> 01:09:01,384
初披露できてとっても嬉しいです！
We're so happy to perform this live for the first time!

868
01:09:01,384 --> 01:09:09,084
side by side is a song made by Aiobahn-san, but also featuring... FUWAMOCO!

869
01:09:09,584 --> 01:09:16,084
We know it's a song that you love a lot, but we also do because...

870
01:09:16,084 --> 01:09:21,084
...it's very special to us, since it's the ending theme for a visual novel that we care about...

871
01:09:21,084 --> 01:09:24,084
NEKOPARA!

872
01:09:24,384 --> 01:09:31,084
And with this song, a dream of singing the opening or ending theme for a visual novel came true!

873
01:09:31,084 --> 01:09:38,384
そう、この楽曲でFUWAMOCOの夢、美少女ゲームの主題歌を歌うことが叶いました！
Yes, with this song, FUWAMOCO's dream of singing a visual novel theme song came true!

874
01:09:38,584 --> 01:09:42,384
A dream came true! Thank you! ありがとう！
A dream came true! Thank you! Thank you!

875
01:09:42,584 --> 01:09:48,384
And thank you so much for joining us for a special day again this year!

876
01:09:48,584 --> 01:09:51,584
It's been a dream, Ruffians!

877
01:09:51,584 --> 01:09:59,084
And you know, it's all because of you that we're able to be here and do all the amazing things that we do, so thank you!

878
01:10:00,965 --> 01:10:01,965
Huh? This next song...

879
01:10:01,965 --> 01:10:04,065
...is our last song?

880
01:10:04,065 --> 01:10:05,865
Aww! But...

881
01:10:05,865 --> 01:10:09,165
...like all of them, it's a very special one!

882
01:10:09,165 --> 01:10:14,465
You know FUWAMOCO are demon guard dogs who are here to protect your smile, right?

883
01:10:14,465 --> 01:10:19,865
We'll continue to do that! Protect your smile! You are our always idols!

884
01:10:19,865 --> 01:10:24,465
And just as I have fluffy and fuzzy souls, too...

885
01:10:24,465 --> 01:10:30,765
We'll continue to be here for thousands and thousands of demon dog years!

886
01:10:30,765 --> 01:10:34,665
Always remembering that, you know, every day isn't given!

887
01:10:34,665 --> 01:10:37,865
Yeah, we don't take anything for granted!

888
01:10:37,865 --> 01:10:42,465
And when you're down, we hope that you'll remember...

889
01:10:42,465 --> 01:10:45,165
...that we're always here cheering you on, okay? We're cheering you on! Love you!

890
01:10:45,165 --> 01:10:50,465
So please listen closely to the lyrics of our last song for today!

891
01:11:05,165 --> 01:11:07,765
明日も 明後日も
Tomorrow, and the day after tomorrow,

892
01:11:07,765 --> 01:11:11,465
あなたが笑ってますように
I hope you'll be smiling...

893
01:11:11,465 --> 01:11:16,465
ずっと... lala...
...forever. Lala...

894
01:11:18,965 --> 01:11:22,465
Thank you so much Ruffians for spending our birthday with us today!

895
01:11:22,465 --> 01:11:26,765
Please think of this song whenever things go wrong, and know that we'll be here!

896
01:11:26,765 --> 01:11:29,965
This last song is for you! Wishful☆Garnet!

897
01:11:33,165 --> 01:11:37,465
過去を振り返ると 思い出す
When I look back at the past, I recall...

898
01:11:37,465 --> 01:11:44,765
ガーネットの空 溢れてく光
...the garnet sky and overflowing light.

899
01:11:44,765 --> 01:11:49,965
この瞳に 映し出された あの日は
That day reflected in these eyes...

900
01:11:49,965 --> 01:11:55,765
美しく 揺れる
...sways beautifully.

901
01:11:55,765 --> 01:11:57,965
What do you think?

902
01:11:57,965 --> 01:12:01,765
紅く 滲んだ 空に
To the sky stained deep red,

903
01:12:01,765 --> 01:12:04,765
願い増した
I made a wish.

904
01:12:04,765 --> 01:12:08,765
どうか この願い
Please, let this wish...

905
01:12:08,765 --> 01:12:11,465
届けてください
...reach you.

906
01:12:11,465 --> 01:12:16,965
明日も 明後日も あなたが笑ってますように
Tomorrow, and the day after, I hope you'll be smiling.

907
01:12:16,965 --> 01:12:22,765
離れ離れになっても 前を向けますように
Even if we are far apart, I hope you can look forward.

908
01:12:22,765 --> 01:12:28,965
あなたを縛る鎖を わたしが壊してあげる
I will break the chains that bind you.

909
01:12:28,965 --> 01:12:34,165
もう 負けないで 進むこと
Don't give up anymore, keep moving forward...

